  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "An information path mortal Gu carries word to Shang clan leader Shang Xin Ci about the contest for Fur blessed land, exposed by the qi tide in central Southern Border and home to Fur true inheritance; because the blessed land belongs to no single super force, Southern Border’s super clans fight over it, and righteous path Gu Immortals agree to send only Gu Masters into the contest while Gu Immortals themselves stay out. The same intelligence names the blessed land’s owner, Fur Immortal, as a dual cultivator of wood path and transformation path who never found an excellent method to reconcile the two; the conflict between her wood and transformation path dao marks has kept her battle strength low her whole life and made her a target of bullying among Gu Immortals.",
